    "label": "28",
    "prompt": "Solve the following equation.\n$$x-\\frac{4}{x}=3.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=4$ or $x=-1$.",
      "worked": "$x\\ne0$. Multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-4&=3x\\\\x^2-3x-4&=0\\\\(x-4)(x+1)&=0\\\\x&=4\\text{ or }x=-1.\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are admissible.",
